  "solution": {
    "text": "When block does not slide with respect to the inclined plane,<br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo></math> normal reaction <math><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi>sec</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi>sec</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math><br /><br />When incline plane is stationary,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">mg</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>"
